      <section class="case-detail-grid">
        <div class="bullet-panel">
          <h2 class="en">Strategy & Execution</h2>
          <h2 class="zh">策略与执行</h2>
          <ul class="en">
            <li><strong>Start with customer-focused keyword research: </strong>Built a database of 200+ hair-care keywords based on overseas customer needs. Used it to improve product pages, English blogs, and metadata on two websites. The project recorded 200% organic traffic growth and a 20% increase in CTR.</li>
            <li><strong>Create content around real customer questions: </strong>Wrote English content about common hair-care concerns. Curly Hair Struggles received 433 comments, providing feedback for future topics.</li>
            <li><strong>Connect useful product content with inquiries: </strong>Improved product information, English copy, and related blog content to explain products and use cases. This work supported 50+ organic inquiries per month.</li>
            <li><strong>Use a publishing process and data to improve content: </strong>Created a content publishing SOP and used GA data to improve topics and pages. Average time on key pages increased from one minute to two minutes.</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="zh">
            <li><strong>从关键词研究建立内容基础：</strong>围绕海外护发行业与客户需求，建立200+行业关键词库，用于两个网站的产品页、英文博客与页面元数据优化。项目自然流量增长200%，CTR 提升20%。</li>
            <li><strong>用真实用户问题带动互动：</strong>围绕海外客户的护发痛点策划英文内容，其中《Curly Hair Struggles》获得433条评论，为后续选题提供用户反馈。</li>
            <li><strong>将产品内容连接到业务询盘：</strong>优化产品信息、英文文案和相关博客内容，帮助海外客户理解产品与使用场景，支持网站每月获得50+自然询盘。</li>
            <li><strong>用发布流程和数据持续改进内容：</strong>建立内容发布 SOP，并根据 GA 数据调整选题和页面内容，使重点页面平均停留时间从1分钟提升至2分钟。</li>
          </ul>
